{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-TW","id":"ep-09","no":"EP.09","tag":"第9話 · 黑羽審判","title":"黑羽審判","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-09:1","s":"n","t":"法庭是一座巨大的鳥籠。圓形鐵欄直通天空，裡面每級臺階上，都坐著身帶灰印、沉默無言的人。","bg":"siksangB","bgm":"warRoom","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-09:2","s":"n","t":"Yeoni連著網吊在被告席，網整夜都沒有鬆過半分。","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"fear"}},{"id":"ep-09:3","s":"yeon","t":"這裡有被告人權之類的嗎？不然豬權也行。","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-09:4","s":"n","t":"穿法袍的烏鴉落在高臺上。面具下看不見眼睛，羽毛法槌敲了桌面一下。","r":{"who":"crow","x":"base"},"sfx":"bell"},{"id":"ep-09:5","s":"crow","t":"開庭。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:6","s":"crow","t":"被告花豬，三項罪名：煽動歌唱，擅自品嚐美食，過度使用感嘆詞。","x":"alt"},{"id":"ep-09:7","s":"yeon","t":"第三個真是頭一次聽說的罪。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-09:8","s":"crow","t":"據紀錄，被告昨日共發出四十七次感嘆詞。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:9","s":"yeon","t":"你還數了？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-09:10","s":"crow","t":"四十八次。","x":"alt"},{"id":"ep-09:11","s":"crow","t":"宣讀範例。哼唧。哼——唧。哼呀。哇。太神了。瘋了。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:12","s":"yeon","t":"聽法官用這種聲音念，真的很羞恥。","x":"shy"},{"id":"ep-09:13","s":"neo","t":"哼呀這個詞，我也是第一次聽。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-09:14","s":"yeon","t":"你也聽過啊！第一天就聽了！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-09:15","s":"n","t":"臺階上幾個人肩膀顫動，在忍笑。烏鴉猛地轉頭，那些肩膀頓時僵住。"},{"id":"ep-09:16","s":"neo","t":"辯護席在哪裡。","x":"serious","c":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"}},{"id":"ep-09:17","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi被羽毛層層纏著，綁在證人席旁，可聲音仍清晰傳遍法庭。"},{"id":"ep-09:18","s":"crow","t":"不准被告有辯護人。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:19","s":"neo","t":"按本島法律，上臺的人可以有一個鼓掌者，我來擔任。","x":"lecture"},{"id":"ep-09:20","s":"yeon","t":"還有這種法律？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-09:21","s":"neo","t":"剛想到的。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-09:22","s":"yeon","t":"律師最棒，五星。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-09:23","s":"crow","t":"……允許。但條件是，鼓掌者不得鼓掌。","x":"alt","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 crow의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-09:24","s":"neo","t":"貓用前爪鼓掌，本來就困難。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-09:25","s":"crow","t":"證物一號。","x":"base","bgm":"midnightPulse","scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 crow의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-09:26","s":"n","t":"一隻烏鴉端來銀盤，上面躺著吃了一半的年糕串。Yeoni眼睛亮了。"},{"id":"ep-09:27","s":"yeon","t":"啊，我的串。","x":"bliss"},{"id":"ep-09:28","s":"neo","t":"Yeoni，對著證物流口水，很難辯護的。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-09:29","s":"yeon","t":"身體先反應，不是我的錯。","x":"shy"},{"id":"ep-09:30","s":"crow","t":"該串檢出了滋味。交代來源。","x":"alt"},{"id":"ep-09:31","s":"n","t":"Yeoni緊閉嘴。摩卡的名字到了舌尖，又退了回去。"},{"id":"ep-09:32","s":"yeon","t":"地上撿的，反正是撿的。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-09:33","s":"crow","t":"追加虛假陳述。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:34","s":"neo","t":"反對。食物好吃，總不能也怪吃的人。","x":"lecture"},{"id":"ep-09:35","s":"crow","t":"駁回。","x":"alt"},{"id":"ep-09:36","s":"neo","t":"反對，不能連讚嘆都算歌唱。","x":"lecture"},{"id":"ep-09:37","s":"crow","t":"被告的哼——唧有音高，從sol落到mi。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:38","s":"yeon","t":"連我的尖叫都配上唱名了？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-09:39","s":"neo","t":"……這麼一聽，確實是sol到mi。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-09:40","s":"yeon","t":"Yeongnyangi！你到底哪邊的！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-09:41","s":"neo","t":"審判長，我對證物保管狀態提出異議。串涼了。","x":"lecture"},{"id":"ep-09:42","s":"crow","t":"這有什麼問題。","x":"alt"},{"id":"ep-09:43","s":"neo","t":"涼串不好吃。不好吃，就不構成擅自品嚐美食。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-09:44","s":"yeon","t":"喔，剛才有點像律師了。","x":"excited"},{"id":"ep-09:45","s":"crow","t":"駁回。被告對涼串也流了口水。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:46","s":"crow","t":"傳證人。","x":"base","bgm":"warRoom","scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 crow의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-09:47","s":"n","t":"鐵欄門開了，灰色市場的奶奶走進來。手背三枚印。她看見Yeoni，輕輕低了低頭。","sfx":"door"},{"id":"ep-09:48","s":"crow","t":"證人，這頭豬是否在市場唱過歌。","x":"alt"},{"id":"ep-09:49","s":"n","t":"奶奶無法回答，印已奪走話語。她把雙手合在胸前，再慢慢展開。"},{"id":"ep-09:50","s":"yeon","t":"那是什麼意思？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-09:51","s":"neo","t":"意思是花開了。你在市場吃糖後微笑時。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-09:52","s":"n","t":"奶奶點頭，臺階上幾個人也跟著展開雙手。無聲的花在法庭各處綻放。"},{"id":"ep-09:53","s":"crow","t":"停下。","x":"base","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 crow의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-09:54","s":"n","t":"烏鴉的聲音第一次劈了。展開手的人趕緊放下。"},{"id":"ep-09:55","s":"yeon","t":"那個，法官，能問一件事嗎？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-09:56","s":"crow","t":"被告不得提問。","x":"alt"},{"id":"ep-09:57","s":"yeon","t":"那我自言自語。為什麼討厭歌到這種地步？歌是搧過法官耳光嗎？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-09:58","s":"yeon","t":"我也因為唱不好，被笑過不少。KTV最高分四十七。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-09:59","s":"neo","t":"四十七，和今天的感嘆詞數相同。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-09:60","s":"n","t":"法庭靜了下來，握著羽毛槌的爪子繃得發白。","bgm":"none","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-09:61","s":"crow","t":"歌聲會招來嘲笑。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:62","s":"crow","t":"沒人唱，就沒人嘲笑。","x":"alt"},{"id":"ep-09:63","s":"yeon","t":"……誰嘲笑過你？","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-09:64","s":"n","t":"槌砸上桌面，桌子裂開。鐵欄上的鴉群齊齊展開翅膀。","fx":"shake","sfx":"thud","scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"shake","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-09:65","s":"crow","t":"判決。","x":"base","bgm":"crisis2","shot":"wide","scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 crow의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-09:66","s":"crow","t":"被告花豬，沒收全部聲音。鼓掌貓按同夥處理，沒收帽子。","x":"alt"},{"id":"ep-09:67","s":"yeon","t":"帽子？為什麼要拿Yeongnyangi的帽子！","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-09:68","s":"crow","t":"世上最喧鬧的帽子。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:69","s":"neo","t":"我就當誇獎了。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-09:70","s":"n","t":"兩隻烏鴉拿著剪刀靠近Yeongnyangi，刀鋒碰到帽尖穗飾。一縷金穗落到地上。"},{"id":"ep-09:71","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi眼也沒眨。Yeoni的呼吸卻急促起來，耳中，心跳如鼓。","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-09:72","s":"yeon","t":"別碰。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-09:73","s":"crow","t":"被告不得發言。","x":"alt"},{"id":"ep-09:74","s":"yeon","t":"我說別碰！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-09:75","s":"n","t":"Yeoni出口的話變成火。文字形狀的火焰竄向空中。別、碰、牠、啊。四團火熔化了剪刀。","fx":"fire","sfx":"fire","im":true,"shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"fire","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-09:76","s":"crow","t":"……傷官。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:77","s":"n","t":"火沒有停。Yeoni每次呼吸，話就更灼熱。鐵欄燒紅，臺階上的人往後退。"},{"id":"ep-09:78","s":"yeon","t":"不喜歡唱歌，你自己別唱就好！為什麼堵別人的嘴！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-09:79","s":"neo","t":"Yeoni，停！","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-09:80","s":"yeon","t":"就喜歡大家這麼安靜地活？沒什麼可笑的島，就那麼好？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-09:81","s":"n","t":"一道火焰轉向臺階，正是奶奶坐的地方。Yeongnyangi撕開纏身羽毛，衝了過去。","c":{"who":"neo","x":"fear"}},{"id":"ep-09:82","s":"n","t":"白光與紅火相撞，Yeongnyangi用前爪擊開火焰。火掠過奶奶頭頂，撞上鐵欄散開。","fx":"flash","sfx":"whoosh","scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"flash","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-09:83","s":"yeon","t":"Ye、Yeongnyangi？","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-09:84","s":"neo","t":"沒事。先呼吸，慢慢來。","x":"calm"},{"id":"ep-09:85","s":"n","t":"Yeoni吸氣，火漸漸弱下去，嘴裡留著焦味。Yeongnyangi卻把前爪藏在背後。"},{"id":"ep-09:86","s":"yeon","t":"我剛才差點打中奶奶。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-09:87","s":"neo","t":"打中了，我會罵你。沒打中，就行。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-09:88","s":"crow","t":"看到了嗎。話語是火，所以才要封住。","x":"alt"},{"id":"ep-09:89","s":"yeon","t":"……","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-09:90","s":"n","t":"這時，法庭頂上的通風口傳來金屬聲。哐噹，哐噹。有什麼正滾下來。","bgm":"warTheme","sfx":"drum","scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-09:91","s":"moka","t":"您點的炸物上桌了！","x":"angry","r":{"who":"moka","x":"angry"},"im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 moka의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-09:92","s":"n","t":"摩卡從通風口落下，掀翻油鍋。麵糊團碰上鐵欄熱氣，白煙爆炸般騰起。","fx":"burst","sfx":"fire","scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"burst","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-09:93","s":"crow","t":"驅散煙霧！","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:94","s":"moka","t":"晚了。我奶奶的煙幕炸物，十分鐘都散不了。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-09:95","s":"yeon","t":"用炸物做煙幕，也行？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-09:96","s":"moka","t":"麵糊裡放雙倍麵粉，不過不好吃，別吃。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:97","s":"yeon","t":"這個最讓人難過。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-09:98","s":"n","t":"摩卡的菜刀割斷網角，Yeoni從被告席滾落。Yeongnyangi咬住後頸，把人拖起。","fx":"claw","sfx":"slash","scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"claw","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-09:99","s":"neo","t":"出口呢。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-09:100","s":"moka","t":"下水道。想活命，就忍著味。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-09:101","s":"yeon","t":"我被網勒得都成花紋豬了，還要下水道？","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-09:102","s":"neo","t":"花紋以後再難過，跑。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-09:103","s":"n","t":"下水道盡頭通向海邊山丘下。傍晚的海沒有聲音，浪湧過來也沒有拍岸聲。","bg":"siksang3","tone":"dark","bgm":"gloom2","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-09:104","s":"yeon","t":"海好像也被蓋印了。","x":"disappoint","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"disappoint"},"c":{"who":"neo","x":"calm"},"r":{"who":"moka","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-09:105","s":"moka","t":"從太陽停下那天就這樣，浪閉上了嘴。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:106","s":"n","t":"摩卡從岩石後拿出小火種罐，用剩餘麵糊煎了張薄餅。這回香味對了。"},{"id":"ep-09:107","s":"moka","t":"吃吧，是好吃的那種。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:108","s":"n","t":"一口咬下，油煎的香味散開，Yeoni的耳朵自動搧了起來。","sfx":"sparkle"},{"id":"ep-09:109","s":"yeon","t":"謝謝……可是你為什麼來？被發現，你也會被蓋印啊。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-09:110","s":"moka","t":"不是說聽見就是同夥嗎。同夥丟下同夥，還算什麼同夥。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-09:111","s":"yeon","t":"你還挺講義氣。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-09:112","s":"moka","t":"不是還挺，是明擺著很講。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-09:113","s":"n","t":"餅吃到一半，Yeoni停了。蹄尖仍刺痛，是火經過的地方。"},{"id":"ep-09:114","s":"yeon","t":"剛才那個，是我。我的話變成了火。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-09:115","s":"neo","t":"傷官，是從你內裡向外釋放的力量中，最鋒利的一種。","x":"lecture"},{"id":"ep-09:116","s":"yeon","t":"那食神呢？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-09:117","s":"neo","t":"同樣的火，朝著讓人吃了會笑的方向燃燒，就是食神。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-09:118","s":"moka","t":"簡單說，烤串的火和燒房子的火。火一樣，用的人不同。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:119","s":"yeon","t":"喔，摩卡老師講得更好懂啊？","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-09:120","s":"neo","t":"我是貓，不擅長比喻，哼。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-09:121","s":"moka","t":"奶奶說過，太陽本來就是用歌聲托起來的。正午大家一起唱，太陽就升得最高。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:122","s":"yeon","t":"那正午唱歌，太陽就會再動？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-09:123","s":"moka","t":"老故事，童話啦，別當真。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-09:124","s":"yeon","t":"我可是特別容易信童話的類型。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-09:125","s":"neo","t":"丙是正午的太陽。若它無法跨過正午，那童話並不算錯。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-09:126","s":"moka","t":"……真的？那奶奶說對了？","x":"base","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 moka의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-09:127","s":"n","t":"笑聲漸止。Yeoni抱住膝頭，望著無聲的浪。","sfx":"heartbeat","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-09:128","s":"yeon","t":"那烏鴉，剛才聲音劈了的時候，看著真的很痛。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-09:129","s":"moka","t":"別同情牠。那傢伙拆走了我奶奶店裡的招牌。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-09:130","s":"yeon","t":"不是同情，只是在想，當時是誰笑了呢。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-09:131","s":"n","t":"沒有人回答。過了一會兒，Yeoni的呼吸慢下來。豬含著餅睡著了。"},{"id":"ep-09:132","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi獨自走向水邊，把前爪浸進無聲的浪裡。","l":null,"r":null,"c":{"who":"neo","x":"sad"},"bgm":"none","shot":"quiet","scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-09:133","s":"n","t":"蒸氣升起。白毛下皮膚燒得發黑，燒痕像一個字。傷。","fx":"water","sfx":"water","shot":"close","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"water","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-09:134","s":"neo","t":"……比想像中快。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-09:135","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi從水裡抽出前爪，攏上毛遮住。回頭時，Yeoni仍在睡。"},{"id":"ep-09:136","s":"n","t":"與此同時，空法庭裡，烏鴉撿起地上掉落的一縷金色帽穗。","bg":"siksangB","tone":"dark","bgm":"crisis","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-09:137","s":"crow","t":"傷官醒了。再這樣，正午就會到來。","x":"alt","r":{"who":"crow","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-09:138","s":"n","t":"烏鴉把金穗放進懷裡。懷中一根黑羽自行顫動，沒有風。"},{"id":"ep-09:139","s":"crow","t":"在那之前，吞掉那頭豬的聲音。","x":"base","im":true,"shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"siksangB","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangB","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangB 배경에서 진행되는 crow의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}}]}
